  "headline": "Svipdagr + Sisters (3-boss) guide (God of War Ragnarok): stop ranged pressure, stabilize camera, then win safely",
  "description": "The 3-boss Berserker encounter is a camera and projectile problem. Fix the order: reduce ranged pressure first, keep multiple threats on-screen, and take only safe end-of-string punishes.",
  "keywords": [
    "svipdagr the cold guide",
    "3 boss fight",
    "berserker",
    "forbidden sands",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\nProjectiles plus melee pressure force panic dodges and off-screen hits.\n\n2) Prep\n- companion stagger/status as a stop tool\n- short runics that can tag ranged targets\n\n3) Fixed order\n1) reduce ranged pressure first (hit the safest ranged target you can reach)\n2) reposition until multiple threats are on screen\n3) punish melee only once, then disengage\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- after projectile volleys\n- after big committed melee swings\n- after fixed-position moves (landings, charge ends)\n\nRelated: use the all-Berserkers index for the full optional-boss route.",
